  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Paracord Bracelet is the ultimate accessory for outdoor enthusiasts and survivalists alike. Crafted from strong 7-strand polyester paracord, this durable bracelet is designed to handle a variety of tasks, from tying supplies together to holding up a tent. The quick-release buckle ensures easy and fast access when needed, making it an essential tool in emergency situations. Measuring 3/4 inch wide and available in sizes ranging from 7 inches to 10 inches, this paracord bracelet offers a comfortable fit for everyone.</p>",
